      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. On going through the materials, it could be seen that on 01.02.2023 at about 09.20 a.m.,\npetitioner was proceeding as pillion rider in a motorcycle bearing Reg. No. KA-51-H-8246 along with his friend Murugan on Big Banyan Tree Road, Ram"
    },
