      "text_preview": "When he reached near Mukthinaga Temple Arch, Ramohalli, at that time all of a sudden a Tipper Lorry bearing Reg. No. KA-41-C-7948 driving by its driver at a very high speed in a rash and negligent manner without observing traffic norms and "
    },
    {
