      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After completion of the investigation, the Investigating Officer has filed charge sheet against the driver of offending vehicle for the offences punishable U/s 279 and 337 of IPC.\n11."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4802cde91d98481cb283309a07c7cd02_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The negligence in common parlance means and simply failure to exercise due care, expected of a reasonable prudent person."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ffedb66757e0466ca533edb483073558_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is a breach of duty and negligence in law ranging from an advertence to shameful disregard of safety of others."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5a4ad3c867844480a7d4571f11b9aef0_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In most instances, it is caused or heedlessness or inadvertence, by which the negligent party is unaware of the results, which may follow from his act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "102b639fd8864bddbd025bdebdda99d3_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNegligence is that, a breach of duty or lack of probable care in doing something."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "baa4f4859357445495d88f405bf15161_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In short, it is want of attention and doing of something, which a prudent and reasonable man would not do."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9d5b38335c204c3ab384ebcb1124cf6a_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The burden is upon the petitioner to prove that, the accident occurred due to negligent driving by the driver of Tipper Lorry bearing Reg. No. KA-41-C-7948.\n12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3c3b1c6cbf5465ba872a74d6d07fe07_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As we know evidence in any Summary Proceedings, \"\nThe act of Negligence\" will have to be assessed on the basis of broad preponderance of probabilities and degree of proof required is not one of beyond reasonable doubt,\nas it is insisted in "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f293956af7b44420911ea62bf0859af1_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
