        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, at least 4 months is required to recover from the accidental injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "24a97a6ee13f420bae4205fcc0b5eb37_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is the further contended that, the injured petitioner was working as Mason and earning Rs.45,000/- per month, but no reliable evidence is produced by the petitioner to show how much income he was getting from his work."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46a2bed9fdb7460189939dc27abde2da_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So, in the absence of any evidence in respect of the income of the petitioner,\nthe petitioner might have monthly income at Rs.16,000/- as per the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka fixed notional income of the year 2023 at Rs.16,000/- per mont"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5b7cf48481b442ae92309d20a1c470c2_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The accident is of the year is 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "633cc9859ce14d72928c12daa6b84e16_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, the income of the petitioner is considered as Rs.16,000/-p.m. as per above decision."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e935fd5e7d804c8fa3da75b1d97a437b_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, 4 months is to be considered as loss of income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fe53b461191c46168590351f380f1429_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled for compensation of Rs.64,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d6241fca4a9e42fcbb2fd02e4f9c7166_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the PW.2 is not a treated doctor."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f364f2cff3134881aad50e915701f4e6_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Same was admitted by the PW.2 during his cross examination, the relevant evidence of the PW.2 reads as follows :\n\"                \n      .\"\nHe was sworn that, petitioner has got 18% disability to the whole body but he was not issued the dis"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4e50e41b8c2745b39685bbe7fd003def_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is quite but natural that to help the petitioner doctor will give exaggerated disability."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "81c1a6b03f964ff79ccaccfa51067762_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, looking to the nature of the injuries it is proper to came to conclusion that there is 8% of disability to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8021a8099f3a4a76873fdf5633a5cd06_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW.3 is only record keeper who has only produced the medical documents and her evidence is formal in nature."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a8e18f60737e44b698b32fefffb4fc0d_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. Before proceeding on merits of the claim the age of the petitioner /injured has to be determined."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1e28026d96e841048b03276d7fd1f75f_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nEx.P.9 is the Aadhar Card of the petitioner, wherein his year of birth is mentioned as 1992 and accident took place in the year 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62ae6915454b43d59050b333a19bc884_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, I assess his age as 31 years at the time of this accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e60917e105bb4c1ab2a2910c1be5fae2_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the ruling reported in AIR 2009 SCW page-3014 between SARLA VERAMA AND OTHERS VS DELHI TRANSPORT CORPORATION AND OTHERS, the relevant multiplier applicable is '16'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dde0bdb5f4154e2db155ecf7d5feb811_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence Rs.16,000 X 12 X 16 X 8% = 2,45,760/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d238db3a8fb46a69a8f4cfbb12ddfdb_113",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under this head the petitioner is entitled for an amount of Rs.2,45,760/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b8c7ed480e7d4179b425189a7bbbb4ac_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. FOOD, CONVEYANCE, NOURISHMENT AND ATTENDANT CHARGES:\nFurther the petitioner has sustained grievous injuries and took treatment as inpatient in KIMS Hospital, Bangalore as inpatient from 01.02.2023 to 15.03.2023 i.e., for 43 days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "52d45fe8bea34ef8ac7de84e7ed7db74_115",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled for compensation of Rs.45,000/- under the head of nutritious food and attendant charges."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0a91ead9f2ff463cbc6e44a12a61f5e7_116",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. LOSS OF FUTURE AMENITIES AND HAPPINESS :"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "23c4de1d07bc42aeb529d59697b053a4_117",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner was aged about 31 years at the time of accident, he has sustained grievous injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0e65733373ea4277b747491b9042dacf_118",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It shows that he found difficulty in doing day to day works."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "63a073b8410740d9ada0e02da69cad59_119",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He might have suffered lot of pain and loss of amenities and comforts in life."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85b243c64a9a48dbb55a1e851463eda5_120",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, considering the age, nature of injuries and percentage of disability, Rs.50,000/- is awarded under the head of loss of future amenities and happiness."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "630d1ac9061842f6ab81dde30f56c4ff_121",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n25. TOWARDS FUTURE MEDICAL EXPENSES :"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "74b80cfa5f5b456e9441f0e6f884ca67_122",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has also claimed compensation towards future medical expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "735ed652456f4678b6c67925bc9204ef_123",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The doctor who has been examined as PW.2 has suggested for removal of the implants and estimate of this surgery will be approximately Rs.30,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a8c3f4cab82149a6a6cebce54d4d3d96_124",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "By keeping nature of the injuries sustained, as he is bound to suffer medical problems in future and cannot every time depend upon Government hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "daa6abf9ff3a4d9f81ae3786cf8d7560_125",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, under this head Rs.20,000/- is awarded."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6ff35a7abcd947f29ec56c145d123988_126",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, the petitioner is entitled for total compensation under the following heads:\n1 Pain and sufferings Rs. 60,000/-\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8f015752889e4338a646b7ca19cc957e_127",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Ranganathan Kannan vs Universal Sampo Gen Ins Co Ltd on 29 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/3953349/\n7"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5a531b13bfeb430e9b43280d2cf0f42e_128",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "2 Medical expenses Rs. 1,22,898/-\n3 Loss of earnings during laid Rs. 64,000/-\nup period 4 Loss of future earning, Rs. 2,45,760/-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b9ae2f05225644fab4676377ebc157d7_129",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Disability 5 Nutritious food and Rs. 45,000/-\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "16bf3cc18fa34e2086a1e6ce8add7bb0_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "attendant charges 6 Loss of future amenities and Rs. 50,000/-\nhappiness"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6708b3e583804683a99e6a8f8f6630ec_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7 Future Medical Expenses Rs. 20,000/-\nTotal Rs. 6,07,658/-\nHence, the petitioner is entitled for total compensation of Rs.6,07,658/- under various heads."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "20da9a831e0a491da3de602c5073ecf2_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. LIABILITY:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7bda8a7274b74a4aa69dc1c3c79b64cd_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As discussed in issue No.1, the accident was occurred due to rash and negligent driving by the driver of the Tipper Lorry bearing Reg. No.KA-41-C-7948 and the police have conducted due enquiry and filed charge sheet against the said driver "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "744e58365104408d86de04377275c655_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From perusal of the policy, the offending vehicle was insured with the respondent No.1 for the period from 09.08.2022 to 08.08.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "174d82b4806141998f2c28f5715aa703_135",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the accident in question took place on 01.02.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4b6c4c55f9c042cf97572c9e4f5e5b7f_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence,\npolicy was in force at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "38b7e5d2cef74f11a1beff2a04d05c88_137",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, in view of above discussion, the respondent No.1 and 2 are jointly severally liable to pay the compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5cfbb5d8a8764ec987cdb5216fb57971_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, respondent No.1 being the insurer is liable to indemnify the respondent No.2 owner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1d217487d0a84d288090797018ba4307_139",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n27. INTEREST:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5870c9d1324a4e6d963b9cf325475f58_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As far as awarding of interest on the compensation amount is concerned, I have relied on a decision reported in M.F.A. No.100090 of 2014 in between Vijay Ishwar Jadhav and others V/s The Divisional Manager, Bajaj Allianz General Insurance C"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb42c4b9160f44479fd706cc7a519e73_141",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "By relying on the aforesaid decision,\n6% interest awarded to the petitioners in the present case on hand."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a703fae938b64d908c044f17fa7ffd2a_142",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, issue No.2 is answered partly in the affirmative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "64576de1edd24bf0ad8db1e80e80760b_143",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n28. ISSUE No.3:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "05b3e47dbead49d99f7612b651a24a8e_144",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of above discussions, I proceed to pass the following:\n:ORDER:\nThe petition filed by the Petitioner under Sec.166 of I.M.V Act is hereby partly allowed with costs.\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c13dba0536054106bf468ebbb41cb731_145",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner is awarded with compensation of Rs.6,07,658/- with interest @ 6%\np.a., from the date of petition till its realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8a4b697e966e4f2f8527a93e96853353_146",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nRanganathan Kannan vs Universal Sampo Gen Ins Co Ltd on 29 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/3953349/\n8"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b4d5d9d78c2a4e30b6aea738f61a5426_147",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent No.1 being insurer of the vehicle involved in an accident is liable to pay the compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3f8cac748d14d7c997179f7f94fb078_148",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Respondent No.1 is directed to deposit the above compensation amount with interest thereon before Tribunal within two months from the date of this award."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5e50549d07554cce8c087269eda55af0_149",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIn the event of deposit of total compensation amount of petitioner, 50% of amount shall be released in his favour along with interest thereon."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "213c5b0aae26413ca595dd1fae756d7e_150",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
